{
  "format": 1,
  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "TUT_ADDON_FORGOTTENRELICS",
      "pages": [
        {
          "id": "forgottenrelics:tut_addon_forgottenrelics/text/1",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.forgottenrelics.tut_addon_forgottenrelics.text.1",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "失落遗物学是什么\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "forgottenrelics:tut_addon_forgottenrelics/text/2",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.forgottenrelics.tut_addon_forgottenrelics.text.2",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "它加入了 35 件强大的"
                },
                {
                  "text": "遗物",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "：采掘护符、维度魔镜、经验之书、雷电与虚空法术，以及带有大量扭曲的终局遗物。多数遗物需要通过扫描发现，再通过注魔制作；许多遗物消耗"
                },
                {
                  "text": "植物魔法的魔力",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "，佩戴在饰品栏中。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "forgottenrelics:tut_addon_forgottenrelics/divider/3",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "forgottenrelics:tut_addon_forgottenrelics/text/4",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.forgottenrelics.tut_addon_forgottenrelics.text.4",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "从哪里开始\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "forgottenrelics:tut_addon_forgottenrelics/text/5",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.forgottenrelics.tut_addon_forgottenrelics.text.5",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "forgottenrelics:GenericTheory"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：永恒遗物理论，需要注魔和神秘锭。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "forgottenrelics:MiningCharm"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：采掘护符（需要元素镐）。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "forgottenrelics:SpellbookTheory"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：法术书基础（需要血腥崇拜）。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "forgottenrelics:SuperpositionRing"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：叠加态之戒（需要邪术揭谛）。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "forgottenrelics:DimensionalMirror"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：维度魔镜，随身传送。\n很多研究是隐藏或失落的，多扫描你在世界中遇到的东西。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "forgottenrelics:tut_addon_forgottenrelics/recommended/divider",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "forgottenrelics:tut_addon_forgottenrelics/recommended/title",
